 "title": "BC856 to BC858 PNP transistors, SOT-23",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "Eight PNP transistors in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package, rated for -0.1 A of collector current and 200 mW of dissipation. BC856 holds off -65 V collector to emitter, BC857 -45 V and BC858 -30 V. The letter suffix is the DC current gain rank at -2 mA: A (125 to 250), B (220 to 475) or C (420 to 800); BC856 is offered in ranks A and B only. BC856B is the -65 V part of rank B. The NPN complements are BC846 to BC848.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Collector-emitter voltage VCEO",
   "-65 V (BC856), -45 V (BC857), -30 V (BC858)"
  ],
